=head1 NAME

pod.config - test config file with POD

=cut

# Description:  Test config file: POD, comments, __END__
#
# test: -s -TestPod vendor/exiftool/t/images/Canon.jpg

%Image::ExifTool::UserDefined::Shortcuts = (   # a comment after code
    TestPod => [ 'Make', # in a list
                 'Model' ],
);

=pod

POD between two statements

=cut

$Image::ExifTool::UserDefined::Shortcuts{TestPod}[2] = 'ISO';

1;

__END__

Everything after __END__ is ignored: sub { my $x; }
